    "body": "fix on issue/2844-strip-division · PR #2934 · pinned by a_four_turn_thread_flank_meshes_at_full_fidelity_in_a_bounded_count, a_wide_twisted_face_keeps_the_planner_division, the `mesh_redivide` and `mesh_redivide_fill` lib tests · merges when reviewed\n\nThe thread flank meshes in 1150 facets, measured 3.8e-3 mm at 5e-3 mm. The known-fail marker is removed. The heavy lanes did not run (246 release steps); the PR body says so.\n",
